# Project Conventions

## Package Manager
- Use `pnpm` (not npm or yarn)
- Build: `pnpm run build`
- Install: `pnpm install`

## Tech Stack
- Browser Extension (Chrome + Firefox)
- TypeScript
- Vite with @crxjs/vite-plugin
- webextension-polyfill for cross-browser compatibility

## Build Outputs
- Chrome: `release/` directory
- Firefox: `dist-firefox/` directory (via `pnpm run build:firefox`)

## Architecture
- `src/background.ts` - Service worker / background script
- `src/content.ts` - Content script injected into pages
- `src/popup.ts` / `src/popup.html` - Extension popup UI
- Translation via Claude API (Anthropic)
